24
00:02:59,170 --> 00:03:05,390
At the cellular level, Cohere provides an entirely genetically encoded toolkit for fine-tuned cell-cell adhesion.

25
00:03:06,090 --> 00:03:11,630
At the molecular level, our model coherotune ensures that our system is functional in a diversity of environments.

26
00:03:12,010 --> 00:03:14,740
