41
00:04:45,090 --> 00:04:50,030
Our collection was designed to be easily expandable to a multitude of other hosts and protein elements.

42
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:57,420
provided a standard template for the addition of new parts as well as validation parts for rapid iteration on design.

43
00:04:59,620 --> 00:05:07,250
At Dry Lab, we developed Coheratune, a model that enhances the stability of adhesion proteins to expand Cohera's applicability.

44
00:05:07,620 --> 00:05:14,350
The heart of this model is our Bayesian optimization algorithm, which we developed with the principle of modularity as our focus.

45
00:05:14,850 --> 00:05:24,820
We apply our algorithm to optimize fitness and stability in Spytag and Spycatcher, and our user manual details how it can be applied to optimize different properties in any given protein.

